  "text": "Veterinary Dermatology, Surgery & Oncology In The North Bay\nHome\nAbout\nOur Staff\nOur Services\nServices\nDermatology & Allergy\nSpecialty Surgery\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nRescue Groups & Shelters\nForms\nDermatology Questionnaire\nVeterinarian Referral Form\nRefills\nVideos\nContact\nFollow\nFollow\nMake an appointment\nProviding Exceptional Compassionate Care To All Animals and The People That Love Them!\nGolden Gate Veterinary Specialists works with pet owners, veterinarians, and animal rescue groups across the Bay Area, providing high-level specialty medicine for animals in need of allergy/dermatology, surgical care, oncology/cancer treatment, and internal medicine.\nOur Practice\nOur Staff\nDermatology\nand Allergy\nSurgical\nServices\nOncology\nServices\nInternal\nMedicine\nSchedule An\nAppointment\nOnline\nPharmacy\nOur\nOffice\nMy dogs suffered from severe allergies for years until we were referred to Dr. Eckholm.  They have been patients for 7 years and we are so happy with the results.  Dr. Eckholm put together a treatment plan for us that has greatly improved the comfort and quality of life for my dogs.  I am so grateful for the care and expertise we have received.\nLinda O.\nAn extraordinarily difficult circumstance led us to an extraordinary human being - Dr. James Farese. We rescue dogs, usually older ones, and with Dr. Farese just a phone call away (he is very responsive to emails, texts and phone calls), we rest a little easier knowing we can call upon him for future surgical needs.\nLaura T.\nPet Owners\nReferring Veterinarians\nShelters & Rescues\nPatient Info\nMake an appointment\nClient Forms\nServices\nPrescription Refill Requests\nResources\nAbout us\nContact us\nReferring Veterinarians\nShelters & Rescues\nBlog\nFind Us\nDermatology, Internal Medicine, Oncology Hours:\nMON-FRI: 8:30 - 5:30pm\nSurgical Hours:\nMON-THUR: 8:00 - 5:30pm\n4460 Redwood Hwy. Suite 11\nSan Rafael, CA 94903\nNavigate to our office\nFollow\nFollow\nDermatology, Oncology & Internal Medicine Department\nPhone:  415-726-2458\nFax: 415-299-8536\nreception@ggvets.com\nSurgery Department\nPhone: 415-213-4746\nFax:\n415-384-9945\ninfo@ggvetsurg.com\nGolden Gate Veterinary Specialists has the only board certified veterinary dermatologistS within San Francisco County, Marin County, Sonoma County, Napa County, Solano County, Lake County, and Mendocino County,\nthe only Founding Fellow of Veterinary Surgical Oncology in the Bay Area, as well as a Medical Oncologist and Internal Medicine Specialist.\nWe serve pet owners from all over the San Francisco Bay Area who are in need of specialty veterinary services.\n© 2026 Golden Gate Veterinary Specialists. All Rights Reserved.  | Site by\nRAD Web Marketing\nFollow",
